d API:\\n- Function extract_from_pdf(filepath: Path, api_key: str, base_url: str = 'https://transform.unstructured.io') -> dict that:\\n  - Uploads PDF to Unstructured API with profile='best', output='elements'\\n  - Handles polling for async jobs (status checking loop)\\n  - Returns the full JSON response\\n  - Saves the raw response to a .json file alongside the PDF\\n\\n- Function parse_items_from_response(response: dict) -> list[dict] that:\\n  - First checks if 'extracted_data' has items (from Extract step)\\n  - If not, looks for Table elements with text_as_html and parses the HTML tables\\n  - If no structured tables, falls back to parsing the text content\\n  - Returns list of {\\\"item_name_raw\\\": str, \\\"source_page\\\": int|None}\\n\\n- Fun\n---\nThe checkpoint summary has been truncated due to hitting max length. Please see the conversation log file for the full conversation."}
