         \n987:                 <div id=\"history-list\" class=\"history-grid\">\n988:                     <!-- History items will be injected here -->\n989:                     <div class=\"empty-state\">\n990:                         <i class=\"ph-fill ph-empty\"></i>\n991:                         <p>لا توجد عمليات سابقة مسجلة.</p>\n992:                     </div>\n993:                 </div>\n994:             </div>\n995: \n996:             <!-- Screen 4: Settings -->\n997:             <div id=\"screen-settings\" class=\"screen\">\n998:                 <header class=\"page-header\">\n999:                     <h2><i class=\"ph-fill ph-gear\"></i> إعدادات النظام</h2>\n1000:                     <p>قم بضبط إعدادات الربط مع سيرفر الذكاء الاصطناعي (MSEMAX) و Unstructured API.</p>\n1001:                 </header>\n1002: \n1003:                 <div class=\"settings-grid\">\n1004:                     <!-- General API Settings -->\n1005:                     <div class=\"settings-card\">\n1006:                         <div class=\"card-header dark\">\n1007:                             <i class=\"ph-fill ph-key\"></i>\n1008:                             <h3>مفاتيح الربط (API Keys)</h3>\n1009:                         </div>\n1010:                         <div class=\"card-body form-grid\">\n1011:                             <div class=\"form-group\">\n1012:                                 <label>Unstructured API Key</label>\n1013:                                 <input type=\"password\" id=\"setting-unstructured-key\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Enter Unstructured.io Key...\">\n1014:                             </div>\n1015:                             <div class=\"form-group mt-2\">\n1016:                                 <label>Local AI URL (MSEMAX / vLLM)</label>\n1017:                                 <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-local-url\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions\">\n1018:                             </div>\n1019:                             <div class=\"form-group\">\n1020:                                 <label>Local AI Key (إن وجد)</label>\n1021:                                 <input type=\"password\" id=\"setting-local-key\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Optional API Key\">\n1022:                             </div>\n1023:                             <div class=\"form-group\">\n1024:                                 <label>اسم الموديل (Model Name)</label>\n1025:                                 <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-model-name\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"gpt-4o-mini, llama3, etc...\">\n1026:                             </div>\n1027:                         </div>\n1028:                     </div>\n1029: \n1030:                     <!-- Server Settings -->\n1031:                     <div class=\"settings-card\">\n1032:                         <div class=\"card-header dark\">\n1033:                             <i class=\"ph-fill ph-hard-drives\"></i>\n1034:                             <h3>إعدادات سيرفر (MSEMAX)</h3>\n1035:                         </div>\n1036:                         <div class=\"card-body form-grid\">\n1037:                             <div class=\"form-group mb-4\">\n1038:                                 <label>مسار مجلد MSEMAX</label>\n1039:                                 <div class=\"input-group\">\n1040:                                     <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-msemax-dir\" class=\"form-control\" readonly>\n1041:                                     <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" onclick=\"selectMsemaxDir()\">تحديد المجلد</button>\n1042:                                 </div>\n1043:                             </div>\n1044: \n1045:                             <div class=\"btn-group-vertical\">\n1046:                                 <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"setupRequirements()\">\n1047:                                     <i class=\"ph ph-download-simple\"></i>\n1048:                                     <span>تثبيت متطلبات الجهاز الأساسية</span>\n1049:                                     <span id=\"req-status\" style=\"margin-right:auto\"></span>\n1050:                                 </button>\n1051:                                 <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"getSession()\">\n1052:                                     <i class=\"ph ph-browser\"></i>\n1053:                                     <span>تجديد الجلسة (Get Session)</span>\n1054:                                     <span id=\"session-status\" style=\"margin-right:auto\"></span>\n1055:                                 </button>\n1056:                             </div>\n1057:                         </div>\n1058:                     </div>\n1059:                 </div>\n1060: \n1061:                 <div class=\"action-bar-bottom mt-3\">\n1062:                     <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-massive\" onclick=\"saveSettings()\">\n1063:                         <i class=\"ph-fill ph-floppy-disk\"></i> حفظ الإعدادات\n1064:                     </button>\n1065:                 </div>\n1066:                 \n1067:                 <!-- System Logs Viewer -->\n1068:                 <div class=\"settings-card\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; border-color: var(--border);\">\n1069:                     <div class=\"card-header\" style=\"background: var(--text-main); color: white;\">\n1070:                         <i class=\"ph-fill ph-terminal-window\"></i>\n1071:                         <h3>سجل النظام (System Logs)</h3>\n1072:                     </div>\n1073:                     <div style=\"background: #1e1e1e; padding: 12px;\">\n1074:                         <textarea id=\"system-logs\" readonly style=\"width: 100%; height: 250px; background: #1e1e1e; color: #00ff00; border: none; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; outline: none; resize: vertical; direction: ltr; text-align: left;\"></textarea>\n1075:                     </div>\n1076:                 </div>\n1077:             </div>\n1078: \n1079:             <!-- سجل النظام (Terminal) -->\n1080:             <div id=\"screen-logs\" class=\"screen\">\n1081:                 <div class=\"screen-header\">\n1082:                     <h2>سجل النظام (Terminal)</h2>\n1083:                     <p class=\"subtitle\">يُظهر مخرجات العمليات الجارية في الخلفية</p>\n1084:                 </div>\n1085:                 \n1086:                 <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; background:#1e1e1e; overflow:hidden;\">\n1087:                     <div class=\"card-header\" style=\"background: var(--text-main); color: white;\">\n1088:                         <i class=\"ph-fill ph-terminal\"></i>\n1089:                         <h3 style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px;\">Pipeline Terminal</h3>\n1090:                     </div>\n1091:                     <div style=\"flex:1; padding: 12px; overflow: hidden; display:flex;\">\n1092:                         <textarea id=\"pipeline-log-terminal\" readonly style=\"flex:1; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 400px; background: #1e1e1e; color: #00ff00; border: none; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; outline: none; resize: none; direction: ltr; text-align: left;\"></textarea>\n1093:                     </div>\n1094:                 </div>\n1095:             </div>\n1096: \n1097:         </main>\n1098:     </div>\n1099: \n1100:     <!-- The original screen-home is removed. We use screen-new as the home page. \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
